            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Voice input and the agent link plug (the plug button in agent pane headers that links two agents) are now off by default, and this release turns both off once for existing users too. To use them again, turn on &quot;Enable voice input&quot; in Settings → Voice or the &quot;Agent link plug&quot; toggle, and Addy will keep your choice.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
